id: pm-j2vwbh
title: Schedule the context decision corpus keeper after parallel contract workers
description: "The complete source coverage run failed only the existing context completion regression that creates200 real child items: its unchanged30000ms deadline expired while parallel contracts and static work were active. The established sequentialPerformanceSpecs contract already isolates corpus and policy keepers but omits this four-test file. Allocate the complete context-decision file to the existing serial phase, preserve every input assertion and deadline, and extend the independent membership keeper and recurrence lineage."
