actual_result: "The independent membership keeper fails before allocation and passes after it. All 6 linked keeper/context tests pass, and complete accepted source coverage passes 10922 tests with 3 configured skips and exact 100/100/100/100. The original context timeout and separate transport-benchmark timeout remain failed historical receipts rather than erased evidence."
